      "raw": "<p>If I were to try and recreate the timeline, hitting every environment and character card, which battles should I do to get closest to the timeline of the Lore?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Preference for at least some new characters each battle and just gloss over battles that don't intro a new variant, villain, hero, or environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI figure the Freedom Five vs Baron Blade at Megopolis would probably be first...and OblivAeon would obviously be last.</p>",
